		(descr "Semtech SX1280/SX1281 QFN-24 4x4 mm P0.5, EP 2.6 (pad 25 = data-sheet pin 0, GND). DENSE variant of ..._W: toe shortened to Z 4.40 (lands 0.60 x 0.30 at +-1.90, heel 1.60 kept) for the 4.4 mm area budget; EP land 2.70 and paste 2x2 x 1.10 mm (66 %) unchanged. Land source: SX1280/1 DS rev 3.2 Fig 17-3 p153. EP vias placed on the board (P5). | IPC-7351 least density (L) variant per D109: toe 2.08 (D 3.90/4.00/4.10 -> 2.05 max + 0.03), heel 1.60 kept (>= D/2-Lmax 1.55), width 0.24 (IPC L side, b 0.18/0.23/0.30), EP 2.70/paste unchanged")
